					"no": {
						"npc_has_class": "NC_ANTHRO_URSINE_MOREHUMAN_FEMALE",
						"yes": "Human serum? That's quite a powerful concoction. I'm grateful for this newfound awareness, Master.",
						"no": "I don't really get it, but sure... So, what now?"
